        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/46a35a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-29T14:09:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Custom picking a team to win seems kind of defeating the point (much like stacking a deck), but i always thought you HAD to draw a card...being able to avoid that could be pretty clutch.&nbsp; Thanks!</p><p>(Tangentially, Runes of Malediction/Ord of Delirum both came into play round 1 in both games...so maybe that's just shitty luck on my part)</p>",
